.\n$$\n\nWhat is ${∇}_{A}L$ at \n$A=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]?$"] ["question-7c674592-16b0-5e5a-b0ac-ce1e62f430e7" :question/worked-solution "The gradient of $L$ with respect to $A$ is a matrix of the same shape as $A$, with $(i,j)$th entry given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂L}{∂{a}_{ij}},\n$$\n\nthe partial derivative of $L$ with respect to the $(i,j)$th entry of $A.$\n\nWriting out $L$ in component-wise notation as \n\n$$\nL={\\sum }_{i=1}^{2}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{3}2{a}_{ij}{y}_{i}{x}_{j},\n$$\n\nwe have\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂L}{∂{a}_{ij}}=2{y}_{i}{x}_{j}.\n$$\n\nThus, ${∇}_{A}L=2(y\\cdot {x}^{T}).$\n\nEvaluating at the given values $x=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]$ and $y=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}],$ we get\n\n$$\n{∇}_{A}L=2([\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 0\\end{aligned}])=2([\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 14 & -7 & 0\\end{aligned}])=[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 28 & -14 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$"] ["question-7c674592-16b0-5e5a-b0ac-ce1e62f430e7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-8abf474a-1fab-5810-988c-58859ca7b121" :answer-field/id #uuid "8abf474a-1fab-5810-988c-58859ca7b121"] ["answer-3b2813e9-da8e-59ae-9d0e-61e685a4f322" :answer/id #uuid "3b2813e9-da8e-59ae-9d0e-61e685a4f322"] ["answer-3b2813e9-da8e-59ae-9d0e-61e685a4f322" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3b2813e9-da8e-59ae-9d0e-61e685a4f322" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-f7a8f364-5251-5618-b38b-b49e3fc2960c" :answer/id #uuid "f7a8f364-5251-5618-b38b-b49e3fc2960c"] ["answer-f7a8f364-5251-5618-b38b-b49e3fc2960c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f7a8f364-5251-5618-b38b-b49e3fc2960c" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-af6ac5dd-6929-5011-8bf3-a504e287864a" :answer/id #uuid "af6ac5dd-6929-5011-8bf3-a504e287864a"] ["answer-af6ac5dd-6929-5011-8bf3-a504e287864a" :answer/type :answer.t